{
  "notes": [
    "Every vector is H_FIELDS_V1 over the eight signed fields; service_signature is excluded from its own digest.",
    "One confirmation type covers INPUT, OUTPUT and a complete evidence bundle. The object difference is carried entirely by canonical TaskDataObjectRefV1, the required nested eight-field projection of §4.2.1.",
    "INPUT and OUTPUT pin producer_kind UNSPECIFIED, verify_round 0, an absent producer_operator and artifact_total_size_bytes 0. An EVIDENCE_MANIFEST confirmation carries the producing role and round, sets size_bytes to the exact manifest bytes and artifact_total_size_bytes to the checked sum of its artifacts.",
    "EVIDENCE_ARTIFACT is never confirmed on its own: it is covered by its manifest hash and that bundle's confirmation, so no artifact vector exists here.",
    "The signing nonce must equal the Builder's current ACTIVE service binding and be non-zero. retention_until_height is a floor promised at signing time; extending the window later does not require re-signing.",
    "Each vector carries mutations[]: one per encodable leaf plus the semantic cases §10.1 names. A mutation only asserts the digest moves or the input is rejected; it never introduces a domain. digest_hex is the value the mutated input produces, so an implementation that ignores a field will reproduce the positive digest and fail here."
  ],
  "schema": "trueopen.task.builder_confirmation.v1",
